      { text: 'RLVR', cls: 'tag-cyan' },
      { text: 'Interactive', cls: 'tag-green' },
    ],
    title: 'The Many Faces of On-Policy Distillation: Pitfalls, Mechanisms, and Fixes',
    desc: 'On-policy distillation can catastrophically collapse or silently fail depending on three subtle traps: prefix mismatch (teacher accuracy drops 62%→46%), biased TopK gradients (causes training collapse), and a structural OPSD limitation where instance-specific PI averages to a weak policy. Interactive visualizations show each failure mode and the fixes that resolve them.',
    date: 'May 26, 2026',
    read: postReadTime('opd-failure-modes'),
  },
  {
    href: '/posts/fast-blt/',
    tags: [
      { text: 'Byte-Level LMs', cls: 'tag-purple' },
      { text: 'Diffusion Generation', cls: 'tag-cyan' },
      { text: 'Speculative Decoding', cls: 'tag-cyan' },
      { text: 'Interactive', cls: 'tag-green' },
    ],
